<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-badges">
      <span class="hero-badge">✍️ Write for TubeBoost</span>
      <span class="hero-badge">🔗 Permanent Dofollow Link</span>
      <span class="hero-badge">🌍 Reach Creators Worldwide</span>
    </div>
    <h1>Write for Us — Guest Post on TubeBoost</h1>
    <p class="lead">Share your creator-growth expertise with YouTube, TikTok and Facebook creators around the world — and earn a permanent dofollow backlink to your site.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn" href="#submit">Submit Your Pitch &rarr;</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost-light" href="#pricing">See Pricing</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<main class="container">

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Why Publish on TubeBoost?</h2>
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="f-icon">👥</div>
        <h3>Creator Audience</h3>
        <p>Your article is read by creators actively searching for earnings, RPM, SEO and growth help — the exact audience for creator tools and services.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="f-icon">🔗</div>
        <h3>Permanent Dofollow Link</h3>
        <p>Every approved post includes a permanent dofollow backlink. We never add rel="nofollow" or delete paid links after a few months.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="f-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3>Fast Review</h3>
        <p>We reply to most pitches within 2–3 business days. Sponsored posts are published within 3 business days of approval and payment.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="f-icon">🏷️</div>
        <h3>Honest, Labelled</h3>
        <p>Sponsored posts are clearly labelled as sponsored. That keeps trust with readers, protects both our sites, and follows Google's guidelines.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Topics We Accept</h2>
    <p>Your article must genuinely help creators. We currently accept guest posts on:</p>
    <div class="chips" style="margin-bottom:16px">
      <span class="chip">📺 YouTube Growth</span>
      <span class="chip">💸 Creator Earnings &amp; Monetization</span>
      <span class="chip">📈 RPM, CPM &amp; Ad Revenue</span>
      <span class="chip">🎵 TikTok Growth &amp; Earnings</span>
      <span class="chip">👍 Facebook Monetization</span>
      <span class="chip">🔍 Video SEO, Titles &amp; Thumbnails</span>
      <span class="chip">🎬 YouTube Shorts &amp; Live Streaming</span>
      <span class="chip">🤖 AI Tools for Creators</span>
      <span class="chip">💼 Creator Business &amp; Brand Deals</span>
      <span class="chip">📊 Channel Analytics</span>
    </div>
    <div class="disclaimer-box">
      <strong>Topics we do NOT accept:</strong> gambling / casino / betting, adult content, crypto or forex "get rich quick" schemes, essay-writing services, pharmaceuticals, CBD, alcohol, weapons, plagiarism or spun content, and anything illegal or misleading. Posts on these topics are rejected without review.
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">Guest Post Guidelines</h2>
    <div class="cards-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>✅ Your article must</h3>
        <p>Be 100% original and unpublished anywhere else (we check for plagiarism and AI-spun text).</p>
        <p>Be at least <strong>1,200 words</strong>, in clear English, with headings, short paragraphs and practical examples or data.</p>
        <p>Teach the reader something useful — guides, case studies and real numbers work best.</p>
        <p>Include only relevant, natural links. One dofollow link to your site (two on Premium).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>🚫 Please don't</h3>
        <p>Submit promotional or sales copy disguised as an article — readers and Google both reject it.</p>
        <p>Use keyword stuffing, link farms, or links to unrelated / low-quality sites.</p>
        <p>Submit the same article to other websites, or re-publish it on your own site afterwards.</p>
        <p>Send payment before your pitch is approved — we will always confirm first by email.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>🛠️ Our editing rights</h3>
        <p>We may edit headlines, formatting, internal links and SEO title / meta to match TubeBoost style.</p>
        <p>We add internal links to relevant TubeBoost calculators and tools where they help the reader.</p>
        <p>If an article stops meeting these guidelines, we may update or remove it and let you know.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="pricing">
    <h2 class="section-title">Guest Post Pricing</h2>
    <p>Introductory rates while TubeBoost grows — your rate is locked in once your pitch is approved. <strong>Submit your pitch first; never pay before approval.</strong> Payment details are shared by email after approval.</p>
    <div class="cards-grid">
      <div class="card price-card">
        <h3>Free Contributor</h3>
        <p class="price">$0</p>
        <p>For genuine experts who want to share knowledge, not promote a product.</p>
        <ul class="result-list">
          <li>1 dofollow link (in article or author bio)</li>
          <li>Full editorial review</li>
          <li>Published in 7–10 days</li>
          <li>No promotional / sales content</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#submit">Pitch a Free Post</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card price-card featured">
        <h3>Sponsored Post ⭐ Most Popular</h3>
        <p class="price">$49</p>
        <p>For brands, tools and services creators would genuinely find useful.</p>
        <ul class="result-list">
          <li>1 permanent dofollow link</li>
          <li>Published within 3 business days</li>
          <li>Clearly labelled "Sponsored"</li>
          <li>SEO title &amp; meta reviewed by our team</li>
          <li>Listed on our Blog page</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn" href="#submit">Pitch a Sponsored Post</a>
      </div>
      <div class="card price-card">
        <h3>Premium Sponsored</h3>
        <p class="price">$99</p>
        <p>Maximum visibility for a launch, tool or service.</p>
        <ul class="result-list">
          <li>Up to 2 permanent dofollow links</li>
          <li>Priority publishing within 48 hours</li>
          <li>Featured on our Blog page for 30 days</li>
          <li>Internal links from related tools / calculators</li>
          <li>Clearly labelled "Sponsored"</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#submit">Pitch Premium</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="muted">Need just a link in an existing article? <strong>Link insertion: $29</strong> — one permanent dofollow link placed naturally in a relevant published TubeBoost article. Choose "Link Insertion" in the form below.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="section-title">How It Works</h2>
    <ol class="result-list">
      <li><strong>Pitch:</strong> Send your topic, target URL and a short outline using the form below.</li>
      <li><strong>Review:</strong> We reply within 2–3 business days — approved, changes needed, or not a fit.</li>
      <li><strong>Write &amp; pay (if sponsored):</strong> Send your draft; for sponsored posts we share payment details only after the draft is approved.</li>
      <li><strong>Publish:</strong> We edit, format and publish your post, then email you the live URL.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="submit">
    <h2 class="section-title">Submit Your Guest Post Pitch</h2>
    <% if (success) { %>
      <div class="disclaimer-box">
        <strong>Thank you — your pitch has been received.</strong>
        We will review it and reply to your email within 2–3 business days. Please do not send payment unless we approve your pitch and share payment details by email.
      </div>
      <p><a href="/blog">Browse our blog while you wait &rarr;</a></p>
    <% } else { %>
      <% if (errors && errors.length) { %>
        <div class="calc-error show" role="alert">
          <ul>
            <% errors.forEach(function(e){ %><li><%= e %></li><% }) %>
          </ul>
        </div>
      <% } %>
      <form method="post" action="/guest-post" class="calc-card" novalidate>
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="gp-name">Your Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="gp-name" name="name" value="<%= values.name %>" required autocomplete="name">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="gp-email">Email</label>
          <input type="email" id="gp-email" name="email" inputmode="email" value="<%= values.email %>" required autocomplete="email">
          <span class="hint">We reply to this email. It is never published.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="gp-website">Your Website</label>
          <input type="text" id="gp-website" name="website" value="<%= values.website %>" placeholder="https://yourwebsite.com" required>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="gp-type">Post Type</label>
          <select id="gp-type" name="post_type">
            <option value="Free Contributor Post" <%= values.post_type === 'Free Contributor Post' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Free Contributor Post — $0</option>
            <option value="Sponsored Post" <%= values.post_type === 'Sponsored Post' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Sponsored Post — $49</option>
            <option value="Premium Sponsored Post" <%= values.post_type === 'Premium Sponsored Post' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Premium Sponsored Post — $99</option>
            <option value="Link Insertion" <%= values.post_type === 'Link Insertion' ? 'selected' : '' %>>Link Insertion in existing article — $29</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="gp-title">Proposed Article Title / Topic</label>
          <input type="text" id="gp-title" name="proposed_title" value="<%= values.proposed_title %>" required placeholder="e.g. How Small YouTubers Can Raise Their RPM in 2026">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="gp-target">Target URL <span class="hint">(the page your link should point to)</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="gp-target" name="target_url" value="<%= values.target_url %>" placeholder="https://yourwebsite.com/page">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="gp-message">Outline / Message</label>
          <textarea id="gp-message" name="message" rows="7" required placeholder="Short outline of your article: main sections, what the reader will learn, and why it fits TubeBoost readers..."><%= values.message %></textarea>
        </div>
        <button class="btn" type="submit">Send Pitch</button>
        <p class="muted">Your submission is stored for our team to review in the TubeBoost admin dashboard. Submitting does not guarantee publication.</p>
      </form>
      <% if (site.contact_email) { %>
      <p class="muted">Prefer email? Pitch us at <a href="mailto:<%= site.contact_email %>"><%= site.contact_email %></a> with the subject "Guest Post Pitch".</p>
      <% } %>
    <% } %>
  </section>

  <%- include('../partials/faq', { faqs: guestFaqs }) %>

  <div class="cta-banner">
    <h2>Ready to Reach More Creators? 🚀</h2>
    <p>Pitch your guest post today — review within 2–3 business days, no payment before approval.</p>
    <a class="btn" href="#submit">Submit Your Pitch &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
